OL,3,ABritain won't tolerate threats on our
OL,4,Asoil, Miliband says as he summons Iran
OL,5,Aambassador
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe foreign secretary has summoned the
OL,8,FIranian ambassador to make clear that
OL,9,F"Britain will not tolerate threats on
OL,10,Four soil" following last month's
OL,11,Fincident at RAF Fairford.
OL,13,FEd Miliband said Iran's "continued
OL,14,Fattempts" to undermine the UK's
OL,15,Fsecurity "through its criminal
OL,16,Fnetworks, proxy groups and state-backed
OL,17,Fmalign activity is unacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
