OL,3,ABritain won't tolerate threats on our
OL,4,Asoil, Miliband says as he summons Iran
OL,5,Aambassador
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham told MPs on
OL,8,FMonday that the incident at the airbase
OL,9,Fin Gloucestershire was "almost
OL,10,Fcertainly directed by Iran's Islamic
OL,11,FRevolutionary Guard".
OL,13,FIran's ambassador to the UK, Seyed Ali
OL,14,FMousavi, said Tehran was not involved
OL,15,Fand was willing to cooperate with
OL,16,FBritish authorities.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
